<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-11-21T11:30:01.958Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:30:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta has intensified its campaign by destroying bridges in Arakan, advancing west of the Sittaung River, planning a 108‑kilometre fence on the Bangladesh border, and conducting an airstrike on a displacement camp in Rakhine, while Sagaing saw junta forces kill 11 people and Starlink outages isolated communities as health facilities continued to be attacked in October 2026. The International Court of Justice ruled that Myanmar committed genocide against the Rohingya, prompting the junta to reject the verdict as unfair and rights groups to call for sanctions, while Rohingya activists say their struggle for justice is still not over. There were 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/19/myanmar-guilty-of-genocide-against-rohingya-un-court-rules&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/21/rohingya-who-escaped-myanmars-genocide-tell-their-stories&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/the-world-this-week/20261120-friends-but-who-benefits-notes-from-an-historic-summit-myanmar-s-genocide-ruling-time-to-bre-join-the-eu&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/myanmar-genocide-ruling-rohingya-say-struggle-for-justice-not-over/a-80003365?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168853&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/law/2026/nov/20/us-eu-reaction-myanmar-rohingya-genocide-icj-ruling-trump-international-law&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOcVY0LUZJSnV1ME83aWZYRUxCcUNxeUFMc3EzbkJoSGtRcHRuVjczdngwRmtCTWJEN1N2YlRqVzJOOGxidTd0a3RuNFdsSkg2UEJtMW9yMTcxMnU1UmJNTFhhZlJMdnRWQXV4QWFtUERhbi1hd2g4YjltZTNXQkNnb3I2R0tuY19rVk5PUWtRb2lYV0dlM01YbU5ZYl9Dc1NCSzNxSlBlNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
